e idea.\r\n\r\nAdds floating \"game view\" toolbar to the non-embedded running project, and intended to replace floating embedded mode (at least as a default option).\r\n\r\n- Unlike limited (no full-screen, most window/screen related methods do nothing, no multiple native windows on macOS) floating embedded mode, project runs as it would after export, and more useful for testing.\r\n- Floating toolbar should be usable in (non-exclusive) full-screen mode as well.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4240c438-c24b-411c-bb28-58fdfcdf2297\r\n\r\n### Known issues:\r\n- Toolbar is part of the running projects and do not follow editor theme.\r\n- Toolbar is moving with the main project window on macOS, but not on Windows/X11/Wayland. This is default transient window behavior on macOS, other platforms will need some extra handling to behave the same.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.",